  m_text: "Greetings Minion! \n\nTis I, the count, informing you that I have taken
    a well deserved vacation from my estate. I'm trusting you will take excellent
    care of my humble home while I am away. \n\nIf you do not, I will have to throw
    you in my bottomless pit.\n\nThank you!"
